    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To find a DS through ONS Bootstrapping, we start by"
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the process initiation and the introductory phrasing."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "checking if the input is a \"URN\"."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the initial verification step to the structural XOR branch point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, we proceed with the step of \"ONS-Resolving URN to a domain-name\"."
      ],
      "justification": "The guard captures the positive condition, leading directly to the specified resolution action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the input is a \"URL\", we simply continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the alternative branch path taken when the input is not a URN."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After this, we again check if the input is a \"URN\" or a \"URL\" and take the corresponding action."
      ],
      "justification": "Both elements correspond to the repeated type check described in the text."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once we have resolved the URN to a domain-name, we send a DNS query."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the step of sending a DNS query following resolution."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The result of this query is a list of URLs"
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the retrieval of the URL list; duplication across modeled paths is treated as acceptable redundancy."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "which we then use to link to a designated DS."
      ],
      "justification": "Corresponds to linking to the designated DS using the retrieved URLs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, we link to the designated DS and the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the finalization actions and structural end nodes for both modeled execution paths."
    }
  ],
